      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "{name} 선수와 한강을 걸었다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You walked along the Han River with {name}.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "596d6bf2-2d0c-58a4-950c-5d7e8e4d31f7",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "바람 좋다…\n사실 프로 되기 전엔 여기 자주 왔어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Nice breeze…\nActually, I used to come here a lot before I went pro.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9e99485f-0894-5690-9f83-ceae2a86f2a1",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "외출 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "2b254aa3-aa1b-5785-b062-caab3174504d"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "fce7d994-4251-5502-9fee-8a6c7df0eb95": "outing",
        "d9c9b87f-e511-5d0e-8b18-ba17f6e64bb1": -1,
        "738856bf-0f64-5995-a11c-7f76f9355632": 2,
        "bbf17a2b-4f95-57b5-bf63-ed17c3116330": "",
        "57ce2993-f468-56b7-81a4-79d427272462": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "03eb1b19-bbbf-5b14-90fe-15a71f750520",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "24172621-089a-5f3f-94ee-b70d10e191e3",
          "text": "그때 무슨 생각 했어?",
          "sharedValues": {
            "d48d9f76-ce3b-5925-8d52-e96a370d4acd": "trust:+6;pmod:all:+1:-1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "c20d7e87-9fcc-5b1f-b8f3-9e92dc7b82c8",
          "text": "지금은 어때?",
          "sharedValues": {
            "d48d9f76-ce3b-5925-8d52-e96a370d4acd": "trust:+5;pmod:all:+1:-1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:24172621-089a-5f3f-94ee-b70d10e191e3": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "What were you thinking about back then?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:c20d7e87-9fcc-5b1f-b8f3-9e92dc7b82c8": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "And how about now?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c472d0f4-4bd0-5eaf-9304-9b035728e3d3",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": -90.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "언젠가 무대에 서고 싶다… 그거요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "That I wanted to stand on that stage someday… that's all.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3fa811d8-efdd-5cda-889f-2edb8c1e84d6",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 170.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "지금은… 좋아요. 진짜로.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Now… I'm happy. For real.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
